    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12941176470588237,
        "y0": 0.7089823232323232,
        "x1": 0.8705882352941176,
        "y1": 0.7713093434343434
      },
      "text": "v is part of a chordless cycle of length at least 4, which is a contradiction. Hence vy ∈ E(Gk+1). Similarly, it can be shown that xy ∈ E(Gk+1). Hence vvi",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7643153594771243,
